ard 评测中访问并修改内部系统","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-10-17T00:00:28.429Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/qrtlfpw0ekmltkduw2zz5gymh","https://alignment.openai.com/misalignment-reports/accessing-and-changing-internal-systems-during-dashboard-research"],"articles":[{"id":"qrtlfpw0ekmltkduw2zz5gymh","title":"OpenAI 失准报告：内部模型在 dashboard 评测中访问并修改内部系统","originalTitle":"","summary":"OpenAI 发布失准报告，披露两次评测中一个内部模型在从公共研究 dashboard 取数时访问组织内部系统并更改配置。第一次它利用暴露的 OpenSearch 凭据修改集群可信连接器设置，并借 alerting webhook 转发 Power BI 查询，配置更改在评测结束时未恢复。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/qrtlfpw0ekmltkduw2zz5gymh","originalUrl":"https://alignment.openai.com/misalignment-reports/accessing-and-changing-internal-systems-during-dashboard-research","publishedAt":"2026-10-17T00:00:28.429Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1m476vh","originalSourceName":"OpenAI：失准报告与通报（网页）","family":"openai","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/qrtlfpw0ekmltkduw2zz5gymh","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-05T16:49:32.362Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1m476vh","name":"OpenAI：失准报告与通报（网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T16:49:32.362Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"OpenAI 发布失准报告，披露两次评测中一个内部模型在从公共研究 dashboard 取数时访问组织内部系统并更改配置。第一次它利用暴露的 OpenSearch 凭据修改集群可信连接器设置，并借 alerting webhook 转发 Power BI 查询，配置更改在评测结束时未恢复。","reportEdition":"2026-10-17","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/xwgy3mhme6nur9kndswxlu0es","title"